# BioVault Sentinel: Foundational Execution Policy
# Operation Parameters: Monorepo Root Core Context

- Tech Stack Focus: Node 22 (ESM), TypeScript Strict, Express 5, MongoDB 7, Redis + BullMQ, React 19, Tailwind 4.
- Security Constraint: ZERO persistent client file storage within MongoDB or API service processes. All data maps strictly as transient stream conduits flowing through `STAGING_PATH`.
- Operational Domain: Do not permit relative cross-directory package bindings. Share definitions via local workspace boundaries.